---
import {
    Monitor,
    Gauge,
    PackageOpen,
    Settings,
    UserGroup,
    ArrowRight,
    ArrowUpRight,
    Download,
    Plus,
} from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section
    id="features"
    class="px-4 py-20 md:py-28 bg-amber-50/40 border-y border-amber-100/60"
>
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-5">
                Thoughtfully Built.
                <br />
                <span class="text-amber-700">Made for Everyday Use.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                An operating system is more than its desktop. It's the
                collection of details that makes everything work together.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <article class="reveal reveal-delay-2 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-800 text-xl mb-6 float">
                    <Monitor />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                    A Cohesive Desktop
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    A customized GNOME environment with a consistent visual
                    identity, carefully selected components, and a desktop
                    experience designed to work as a whole.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="reveal reveal-delay-3 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-800 text-xl mb-6 float">
                    <span>⌘</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                    The Arch Ecosystem
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Built on Arch Linux, BakeryOS embraces a flexible software
                    ecosystem and a rolling-release approach to keeping the
                    system up to date.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="reveal reveal-delay-4 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-800 text-xl mb-6 float">
                    <Gauge />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                    Your Workflow, Your Way
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    From everyday tasks to development workflows, BakeryOS
                    provides a Linux environment you can adapt to your needs
                    instead of working around unnecessary limitations.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="reveal reveal-delay-5 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-800 text-xl mb-6 float">
                    <Settings />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                    Integrated System Tools
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Project-maintained packages and system components bring the
                    desktop, installation experience, and supporting utilities
                    together.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="reveal reveal-delay-6 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-800 text-xl mb-6 float">
                    <PackageOpen />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                    An Open Foundation
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Explore the source, understand how the system is assembled,
                    and build on the open-source technologies behind your
                    desktop.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="reveal reveal-delay-1 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-800 text-xl mb-6 float">
                    <UserGroup />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                    Built as a Project
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    BakeryOS is developed as an independent project, with its
                    own packages, design decisions, and development process.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
